  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1609.05 Storage of Explosives.\n\n(a) High explosives shall be stored in Types 1, 2, or 3 magazines as set forth in Saf-C 1610, 1611, and 1612.\n\n(b) Low explosives shall be stored in Types 1, 2, 3, or 4 magazines as set forth in Saf-C 1610, 1611, 1612, and 1613.\n\n(c) Blasting agent explosives shall be stored in Types 1, 2, 3, 4, or 5 magazines as set forth in Saf-C 1610, 1611, 1612, 1613, and 1614.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
